                "entry_id": "34bd4314-540d-3042-9524-12e10aac8c7f",
                "word": "Hebei",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ec9a3077-f526-3db2-afd8-2fa28a8c66b5",
                        "entry_id": "34bd4314-540d-3042-9524-12e10aac8c7f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A province in northern China. Capital: Shijiazhuang."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8be1f93d-bc5c-473f-a708-3c42e3a82c28",
                                "sense_id": "ec9a3077-f526-3db2-afd8-2fa28a8c66b5",
                                "text": "Police in northern China have arrested 27 people in their probe into tainted milk that has sickened 53,000 children and embarrassed China's reputation abroad, state media reported Tuesday.\nThe 27 are among 36 detained since law enforcers in Hebei province started investigating Sanlu Group, the company at the centre of the scandal, earlier this month."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e100b1b-5f17-4cc5-88e8-8ab8f9365188",
                                "sense_id": "ec9a3077-f526-3db2-afd8-2fa28a8c66b5",
                                "text": "According to figures published by the Ministry of Environmental Protection (MEP), Hebei's provincial capital of Shijiazhuang saw the highest average reading in all of China last year of particulate matter with a width of 2.5 microns, known as PM2.5, which is easily inhaled into the lungs to cause respiratory damage.\nHebei's smog levels have an outsized effect on China's capital of Beijing since the province surrounds the city.\nAlso among China's ten worst performing cities were Hebei's cities of Handan and Tangshan, the world's biggest steel producing city, as well as Xingtai, Baoding and Hengshui."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "489de502-ee37-48de-8f0f-db50dead4314",
                                "sense_id": "ec9a3077-f526-3db2-afd8-2fa28a8c66b5",
                                "text": "More than 360 people have tested positive for coronavirus in an outbreak in Hebei province, south of Beijing. The National Health Commission reported yesterday that 69 new cases had been confirmed in 24 hours, including 46 in Hebei. Travel between Hebei and Beijing has been restricted, with workers having to show proof of employment to enter the capital."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c13d6e5f-50d4-4219-817f-4989fbcb7be4",
                                "sense_id": "ec9a3077-f526-3db2-afd8-2fa28a8c66b5",
                                "text": "So far, at least 22 people have died in Beijing and the surrounding Hebei province this week amid the heavy rains. State media reported Saturday that waters have started to recede in the hard-hit Hebei city of Zhuozhou."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7d3fe42c-f104-3333-a13d-a925a3c8d3ea",
                        "entry_id": "34bd4314-540d-3042-9524-12e10aac8c7f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A district of Tianjin, China."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef7cc685-4026-4bb5-b275-a2d0ddbb5e42",
                                "sense_id": "7d3fe42c-f104-3333-a13d-a925a3c8d3ea",
                                "text": "The Dabei (Mahakaruna) Temple on Tianwei Road in the Hebei District is the only Buddhist temple of good size in Tianjin.",
                                "translation": "中国佛教",
                                "english": "中国佛教"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f3f27c2-1cea-4a18-bbff-a36e5b3164ab",
                                "sense_id": "7d3fe42c-f104-3333-a13d-a925a3c8d3ea",
                                "text": "Totally, Tianjin has four passenger railway stations, of which the Tianjin North Railway Station, located in Hebei District, is where the Beijing-Harbin Railway and the Beijing-Shanghai Railway meet.",
                                "translation": "中国旅游出版社",
                                "english": "中国旅游出版社"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "58445f68-e0e9-41a6-9733-8e62b0bb49f9",
                                "sense_id": "7d3fe42c-f104-3333-a13d-a925a3c8d3ea",
                                "text": "Hebei district is an area that is not as frantic as its neighbor Heping district and offers lots of cultural sightseeing within walking distance like the Ancient Culture Street, Wanghailou Church and Shizilin Bridge.",
                                "translation": "五洲传播出版社",
                                "english": "五洲传播出版社"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b63dc946-0d8d-4718-9fe3-77fde6ca5113",
                                "sense_id": "7d3fe42c-f104-3333-a13d-a925a3c8d3ea",
                                "text": "Ms. Li Xiaoxia, Deputy Mayor of the Hebei District People’s Government of Tianjin Municipality, addressed in her speech the significance of the project for the Hebei District. Ms Xiaoxia^([sic]) reiterated the District Government’s strong support and commitment to quality education and lifelong learning in Tianjin City."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
